{"ID":"20240314091841-gf8t5eb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091841-gf8t5eb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091841-gf8t5eb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170303-ijguabt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170303-pvlhtvq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170303-pvlhtvq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:168,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:168\u0026#125;","title":"【诃黎勒散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170303-ijguabt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170303-ijguabt","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气利，诃黎勒散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170303-e4qos7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170303-e4qos7y","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"诃黎勒散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170303-ahig0pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170303-ahig0pf","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"诃梨勒（煨）十枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170303-0ktxchd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170303-0ktxchd","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右一味为散，粥饮和，顿服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170303-52i8owf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170303-52i8owf","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这一篇最后呢，大家看"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"气利"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，什么叫气利哦？如果病人从你诊所门口，进入你的诊所门诊部到你的办公室，一路放屁过来，已经看完了，已经结束了哦，你不用讲话，你也不用进来了，马上打电话给药房，诃黎勒散（笑）。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170303-mll9gyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170303-mll9gyn","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个呢一定要煨过就是烤熟，烤熟以后给他吃，这是散剂，吃下去要用米粥，或者是...外国人没有吃稀饭啦，你用那个面汤也可以，顿服就好了，这个专门是对气利。排气很凶哦，那这是唯一的处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170303-pvlhtvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170303-pvlhtvq","updated":"20240422170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个诃黎勒本身呢，因为它是收敛的药，是固肠的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"气利的原因呢？就是小肠里面有宿便在里面，大肠里面没有"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可是他又不是小承气汤症，为什么？小承气汤症的话你便秘呀，他没有，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他还是会排大便，但是沼气就一直排出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这时候我们要加些收敛的药，这个症状用的不多。所以你诃黎勒可以烤一次放在那边，放在冰箱里面等他，等哪个人来，平常很少用到。我们暂停一下。"}]}]}